  "totalBlocks": 47,
  "translatedBlocks": 47,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "63e9ef2e58e69611",
      "translationZh": "Open Responses 是一项全新的开放推理标准。它由 OpenAI 发起、由开源 AI 社区构建，并得到 Hugging Face 生态系统的支持。Open Responses 基于 Responses API，面向智能体的未来而设计。在这篇博文中，我们将探讨 Open Responses 的工作原理，以及开源社区为什么应该使用 Open Responses。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3190becc74cf7675",
      "translationZh": "聊天机器人的时代早已过去，智能体已在推理工作负载中占据主导地位。开发者正在转向能够在较长时间跨度内进行推理、规划和行动的自主系统。尽管发生了这种转变，生态系统中的很大一部分仍在使用 Chat Completion 格式；这种格式是为轮流对话设计的，难以满足智能体应用场景的需求。Responses 格式旨在解决这些局限，但它是封闭的，采用范围也不够广泛。尽管存在替代方案，Chat Completion 格式仍然是事实上的标准。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8b359cbffc535f90",
      "translationZh": "智能体工作流的需求与根深蒂固的接口之间存在这种错配，因此需要一项开放的推理标准。在接下来的几个月里，我们将与社区及推理服务提供商合作，实施和调整 Open Responses，使其成为一种在实践中能够替代聊天补全的通用格式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d400575f7079057d",
      "translationZh": "Open Responses 沿着 OpenAI 在 2025 年 3 月推出 Responses API 时确立的方向继续发展。该 API 取代了原有的 Completion 和 Assistants API，以一致的方式实现以下功能：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cde3e7ff0fab3a33",
      "translationZh": "生成文本、图像和 JSON 结构化输出",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4c2937c4a32f9686",
      "translationZh": "通过单独的基于任务的端点创建视频内容",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "42026fbee6e1f621",
      "translationZh": "在提供商端运行智能体循环，自主执行工具调用并返回最终结果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ca9d33699490d5eb",
      "translationZh": "什么是 Open Responses？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5ff7a372f0ee68a3",
      "translationZh": "Open Responses 扩展了 Responses API 并将其开源，让开发者和路由服务提供商能够更便捷地实现互操作，并围绕共同关切开展协作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f950f13183316cd1",
      "translationZh": "其中一些要点包括：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "40ee16981b249f25",
      "translationZh": "默认无状态，并为有需要的提供商支持加密推理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ebdffeb022dc7117",
      "translationZh": "标准化的模型配置参数。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5b3f0b488c164e5f",
      "translationZh": "流式传输被建模为一系列语义事件，而非原始文本或对象增量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8037bf238749519a",
      "translationZh": "可通过特定模型提供商专用的可配置参数进行扩展。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f15dd3bbd893c6d6",
      "translationZh": "使用 Open Responses 进行开发，需要了解什么？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "636ccf099074ee6f",
      "translationZh": "我们将简要探讨影响大多数社区成员的核心变化。如果你想深入了解该规范，请查阅 Open Responses 文档。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f0974a0e74136367",
      "translationZh": "向 Open Responses 发起客户端请求",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "711138da180cfec1",
      "translationZh": "向 Open Responses 发起的客户端请求与现有 Responses API 的请求类似。下面我们演示如何使用 curl 向 Open Responses API 发起请求。我们调用的是一个代理端点，该端点使用 Open Responses API 模式将请求路由到推理服务提供商。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "47decf939d73f270",
      "translationZh": "推理客户端和提供商需要做出的变更",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cb49b14643553244",
      "translationZh": "已经支持 Responses API 的客户端只需付出相对较少的工作，就能迁移到 Open Responses。主要变更涉及推理内容的暴露方式：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e4874518c8c4e687",
      "translationZh": "扩展推理可见性：Open Responses 为推理项正式定义了三个可选字段：content（原始推理轨迹）、encrypted_content（提供商特定的受保护内容）和 summary（由原始轨迹经净化处理后生成的摘要）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "63d96838a73a0bf9",
      "translationZh": "OpenAI 模型过去只暴露 summary 和 encrypted_content。借助 Open Responses，提供商可以通过 API 暴露其原始推理。从此前仅返回摘要和加密内容的提供商迁移而来的客户端，现在将有机会接收和处理原始推理流，前提是所选提供商支持这一功能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "38f6e148139ba8d3",
      "translationZh": "实现更丰富的状态变化和载荷，包括更详细的可观测性——例如，托管的 Code Interpreter 可以发送特定的 interpreting 状态，以便在长时间运行的操作中，让智能体和用户更清楚地了解运行情况。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "38300f95aa50dd87",
      "translationZh": "对于模型提供商，如果已经遵循 Responses API 规范，那么实现 Open Responses 所需的变更应该并不复杂。对于路由服务，现在则有机会统一采用一致的端点，并支持配置选项，以便在需要时进行定制。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "268572ef99f9923d",
      "translationZh": "随着时间的推移，服务提供商不断创新，某些功能将被纳入基础规范，成为标准。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5ed1c59542f88ed1",
      "translationZh": "总之，随着旧版 Completions API 中未记录在文档中的扩展、不同解读和变通方案在 Open Responses 中得到规范化，迁移到 Open Responses 将使推理体验更加一致，并提高质量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fc64518b6f772953",
      "translationZh": "下方展示了如何以流式方式传输推理片段。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0627f01f99fa0a19",
      "translationZh": "以下是获取 Open Response 与使用 OpenAI Responses 来接收推理增量之间的区别：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "12d1c805b0adcb86",
      "translationZh": "用于路由的 Open Responses",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9880d0a2ac433646",
      "translationZh": "Open Responses 区分了“模型服务提供商”（Model Providers）——即提供推理服务的一方——和“路由器”（Routers）——即在多个服务提供商之间进行编排的中间方。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "80c5f9b350ce703d",
      "translationZh": "客户端现在可以在发出请求时指定服务提供商及其专属 API 选项，从而让作为中间方的路由器能够在上游服务提供商之间编排请求。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ea93d6a262ecb87a",
      "translationZh": "工具",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ca8a49aedb8818b4",
      "translationZh": "Open Responses 原生支持两类工具：内部工具和外部工具。外部托管工具在模型提供商的系统之外实现，例如需要执行的客户端函数或 MCP 服务器。内部托管工具则位于模型提供商的系统之内，例如 OpenAI 的文件搜索或 Google Drive 集成。模型完全在提供商的基础设施内调用、执行工具并获取结果，无需开发者介入。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fbf9168d4d3719f2",
      "translationZh": "子智能体循环",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "41b72ab77d58f53f",
      "translationZh": "Open Responses 对智能体循环进行了形式化定义。这种循环通常由推理、工具调用和响应生成的反复迭代组成，使模型能够自主完成多步骤任务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aa52a2c9f3589635",
      "translationZh": "图片来源：openresponses.org",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d4c1ca5eea996994",
      "translationZh": "该循环的运行方式如下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3a62c52dde887565",
      "translationZh": "API 接收用户请求，并从模型中采样",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "83585ff056309f43",
      "translationZh": "如果模型输出工具调用，API 就会执行该调用（在内部或外部执行）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2d8dba9fea491263",
      "translationZh": "工具结果会反馈给模型，以继续进行推理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "74baba6de3970b9f",
      "translationZh": "循环不断重复，直到模型发出完成信号",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aad8d88a91857c74",
      "translationZh": "对于内部托管的工具，提供商负责管理整个循环：执行工具、将结果返回给模型，以及流式传输输出。这意味着，像“搜索文档、总结发现，然后起草一封电子邮件”这样的多步骤工作流只需一次请求。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b4b8df59c3909b11",
      "translationZh": "客户端通过 max_tool_calls 限制迭代次数，并通过 tool_choice 限定可调用的工具，从而控制循环行为：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ebdc9d0bfaef5335",
      "translationZh": "响应包含所有中间项：工具调用、结果和推理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "759f4c0213571add",
      "translationZh": "后续步骤",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bc6263248f461b5d",
      "translationZh": "Open Responses 扩展并改进了 Responses API，提供了更丰富、更详细的内容定义、兼容性和部署选项。它还提供了一种标准方式，可在主推理调用期间执行子智能体循环，为 AI 应用开启强大的能力。我们期待与 Open Responses 团队及广大社区共同推进该规范的未来发展。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a696a68eda4dc447",
      "translationZh": "你现在就可以通过 Hugging Face Inference Providers 试用 Open Responses。我们已在 Hugging Face Spaces 上提供了一个抢先体验版本，今天就用你的客户端和 Open Responses Compliance Tool 来试试吧！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
  "wordWise": [
